1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Welcome to Rituals. Show up, or pay up… where you put a stake on a weekly promise.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:16,799
Fresh wallet, nothing in it. I tap Get test tokens: 50 of them plus a little devnet SOL. Nothing to sign. Then we start one.

3
00:00:16,899 --> 00:00:25,698
Step one, we name it. Mine's Touch grass. I decide what counts: two hours outside, phone in pocket.

4
00:00:25,798 --> 00:00:39,096
Step two: how many weeks, and how many tokens. Two weeks and 20 tokens, an even split. Any combination up to 16 weeks works.

5
00:00:39,196 --> 00:00:51,493
Next, where the stake goes if you miss a week's check-in. A few demo options, or a wallet address of your choice. I pick City Animal Shelter, and lock it in.

6
00:00:51,593 --> 00:01:12,826
Seed Vault Wallet warns it doesn't recognize this domain, because the APK is sideloaded. Double-tap, fingerprint. One approval creates it, stakes it and activates it.

7
00:01:12,926 --> 00:01:21,023
Week one opens in 25 seconds. Demo speed means a week is about a minute and a half.

8
00:01:21,123 --> 00:01:24,323
I fill in a quick note here to remember what I did.

9
00:01:24,423 --> 00:01:27,923
Week one is open.

10
00:01:28,023 --> 00:01:38,727
Now I hold, and the ring fills up. For now Rituals works on the honor system; there are plans on the roadmap to change that.

11
00:01:38,827 --> 00:01:54,061
Second wallet approval, for the check-in stamp. Same drill: double-tap, fingerprint. It thinks about it, says success, and I'm back in the app.

12
00:01:54,161 --> 00:02:00,859
Then confetti. You showed up! A little fun never hurts.

13
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:10,958
Week two. The clock's at 3x so you don't have to sit through it. I'll stamp it later. Wink wink. Totally.

14
00:02:11,058 --> 00:02:19,457
Then the week gets away from me. Toddler this and that, snack, bath, twelve books for bedtime. The time goes by.

15
00:02:19,557 --> 00:02:28,857
Timer hits zero. The week is missed and closing. No approval needed this time; the app handles it with its own key.

16
00:02:28,957 --> 00:02:40,877
Side by side: KEPT, 10 back to me with my note. MISSED, 10 to the shelter. Same promise, two outcomes. But hey, at least it's a good cause.

17
00:02:40,977 --> 00:02:50,457
That's it. All devnet, all test tokens, and Rituals takes nothing. Show up, or pay up.

